 "cues": [
  {
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 2.9,
   "text": "Data Studio is free and powerful."
  },
  {
   "start": 3.1,
   "end": 8.26,
   "text": "But a good dashboard still takes hours\nof drag-and-drop and design sense."
  },
  {
   "start": 8.46,
   "end": 15.44,
   "text": "What if I could just talk it through,\nand get a real report at the end?"
  },
  {
   "start": 15.64,
   "end": 19.51,
   "text": "That's what this app does.\nLet me show you."
  },
  {
   "start": 20.3,
   "end": 23.94,
   "text": "I start a new build and upload\nmy e-commerce sales CSV."
  },
  {
   "start": 24.14,
   "end": 28.43,
   "text": "It loads the file into BigQuery\nand reads the columns and their types."
  },
  {
   "start": 28.63,
   "end": 30.94,
   "text": "A CSV is just one way in."
  },
  {
   "start": 31.14,
   "end": 35.43,
   "text": "It also takes BigQuery tables, a CSV\nin Cloud Storage, or a screenshot."
  },
  {
   "start": 35.63,
   "end": 39.59,
   "text": "Or I just ask a question,\nand research mode finds the data."
  },
  {
   "start": 40.3,
   "end": 46.75,
   "text": "First it asks what I need.\nI type a few notes in my own words."
  },
  {
   "start": 46.95,
   "end": 52.11,
   "text": "It drafts who the dashboard is for\nand what it must answer."
  },
  {
   "start": 52.31,
   "end": 57.9,
   "text": "Like an analyst would: an audience,\nand the KPIs that matter to them."
  },
  {
   "start": 58.1,
   "end": 64.55,
   "text": "I fix one KPI card. Then it proposes\nan outline, and I pick the parts."
  },
  {
   "start": 65.3,
   "end": 70.04,
   "text": "Next, the look. I pick a design preset."
  },
  {
   "start": 70.24,
   "end": 77.3,
   "text": "It turns the outline into a blueprint:\nevery chart, field and filter."
  },
  {
   "start": 77.5,
   "end": 83.4,
   "text": "Then it builds an HTML prototype\nof the whole dashboard."
  },
  {
   "start": 83.6,
   "end": 89.5,
   "text": "A designer's layout, before anything\nis built in Data Studio."
  },
  {
   "start": 89.7,
   "end": 94.44,
   "text": "Nothing is built yet,\nso changes are cheap."
  },
  {
   "start": 95.3,
   "end": 100.14,
   "text": "Want a change? I click the title\nand leave a comment."
  },
  {
   "start": 100.34,
   "end": 105.7,
   "text": "It applies my comment and redraws\nthe prototype with the new title."
  },
  {
   "start": 105.9,
   "end": 110.3,
   "text": "Any part of the prototype takes\na comment like this."
  },
  {
   "start": 110.5,
   "end": 114.47,
   "text": "Once it's built, each change\nbecomes a new version."
  },
  {
   "start": 115.3,
   "end": 118.54,
   "text": "I ask for a 3D globe of orders."
  },
  {
   "start": 118.74,
   "end": 121.55,
   "text": "It refuses: Data Studio can't do that."
  },
  {
   "start": 121.75,
   "end": 124.56,
   "text": "What I approve is what gets built."
  },
  {
   "start": 125.3,
   "end": 129.96,
   "text": "Every step shows up in the activity\nstrip, with its token count."
  },
  {
   "start": 130.16,
   "end": 135.15,
   "text": "The trace links each call back to\nits node in the ADK graph."
  },
  {
   "start": 135.35,
   "end": 139.59,
   "text": "So I can see what it did\nand what it cost."
  },
  {
   "start": 140.3,
   "end": 145.46,
   "text": "Happy with it, I generate the recipe:\na list of build steps."
  },
  {
   "start": 145.66,
   "end": 150.4,
   "text": "Then the engine drives Data Studio\nin Chrome, step by step."
  },
  {
   "start": 150.6,
   "end": 153.61,
   "text": "Each step turns green as it lands."
  },
  {
   "start": 153.81,
   "end": 158.97,
   "text": "This part is sped up,\nas the label in the corner shows."
  },
  {
   "start": 159.17,
   "end": 164.33,
   "text": "The result: a real Data Studio report,\nin my own Google account."
  },
  {
   "start": 165.3,
   "end": 170.96,
   "text": "No data, just a dashboard I like?\nI give it a screenshot."
  },
  {
   "start": 171.16,
   "end": 175.86,
   "text": "Here's an earlier build from History,\nstarted from a screenshot."
  },
  {
   "start": 176.06,
   "end": 180.76,
   "text": "It can recreate that dashboard,\nor just borrow its style."
  },
  {
   "start": 180.96,
   "end": 186.1,
   "text": "There was no data, so it synthesized\nsample data to match."
  },
  {
   "start": 186.3,
   "end": 189.51,
   "text": "And here is the report it built."
  },
  {
   "start": 190.3,
   "end": 195.92,
   "text": "Under the hood: an ADK 2.0 graph\nof LLM nodes and plain code nodes."
  },
  {
   "start": 196.12,
   "end": 199.69,
   "text": "A feasibility gate refuses what\nData Studio can't do."
  },
  {
   "start": 199.89,
   "end": 202.29,
   "text": "The harness has three memories."
  },
  {
   "start": 202.49,
   "end": 207.68,
   "text": "Skills, for how to do each step.\nOKF semantic memory, instead of RAG."
  },
  {
   "start": 207.88,
   "end": 212.32,
   "text": "And episodic memory in SQLite,\nwith every run and its trace."
  },
  {
   "start": 212.52,
   "end": 218.14,
   "text": "The app runs on Cloud Run. A small\nbuild agent runs on your machine,"
  },
  {
   "start": 218.34,
   "end": 224.39,
   "text": "so the report is built in your own\nData Studio, and your sign-in stays home."
  },
  {
   "start": 225.3,
   "end": 233.52,
   "text": "To try it: \"Set up this computer\" once,\nthen build into your own account."
  },
  {
   "start": 233.72,
   "end": 239.62,
   "text": "Code on GitHub.\nThe hosted link is in the submission."
  }
 ],
